Context()->texStrings;
BEGIN_TEXT
Let \( F(x,y) = (2x+\sin(y)\cos(y), -y+\cos(x)e^x) \) and \( C \) be the  boundary of a triangle with vertices \( (0,0),(1,0) \) and \( (0,1) \). Compute the outward flux of \( F \) through \( C \). \( \textit{Hint:} \) This is fast. 
 $BR


\{$q1->ans_rule\} $BR




END_TEXT
Context()->normalStrings;

##############################################################
#
#  Answers
#
#

ANS($q1->with(tolerance=>.01)->cmp);



# default tolerance is .01 or one percent.


ENDDOCUMENT(); 